WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,470
boss

2
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:01,880
My brother Xiao comes from the mountainous area.

3
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:02,840
It's not easy for him

4
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:04,520
I just like to collect some old clothes and old quilts like this

5
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:06,200
Get it back for the children in their village

6
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,720
Especially now that the weather is getting cooler

7
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:08,880
It's very cold in their mountainous areas

8
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,120
Just need this kind of thing when the cold comes

9
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,320
He doesn't mind whether it's old or not.

10
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,040
The most important thing is that it can be used

11
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,200
little brother

12
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:16,480
You really need these things. You do.

13
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:18,640
We really need these things now

14
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:20,400
Otherwise I wouldn't come here to work

15
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,000
I have to do something like this.

16
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,320
It's because we are very poor there

17
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,560
We don’t have these good supplies

18
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,600
Since this is the case

19
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:27,640
Anyway, I have to sell these things at a low price.

20
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:29,200
Then I might as well give it to you.

21
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:30,720
And I won’t charge you that much money either.

22
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:33,560
I originally planned to sell this bed to others for 50 yuan a bed.

23
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:36,320
I'll charge you 40 yuan per bed here. Thank you, boss.

24
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,400
Then can you help me see how many beds there are in total?

25
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:39,480
I'll see if I can buy it

26
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,120
I have a total of 32 beds here

27
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:42,200
40 yuan a bed

28
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,720
It’s just 1,180 yuan. I’ll take it all.

29
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:48,430
Then I'll ask them to move it all out, boss

30
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:49,990
1280 yuan for you

31
00:00:49,990 --> 00:00:51,350
You said besides these things

32
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:52,590
Is it right to save clothes as well?

33
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:54,590
Then why don't you wait here for a while?

34
00:00:54,590 --> 00:00:55,990
We have a lot of clothes savers here.

35
00:00:55,990 --> 00:00:57,670
And maybe there are people around

36
00:00:57,670 --> 00:00:59,150
I'm going to ask them for some rescue clothes.

37
00:00:59,150 --> 00:01:01,070
Please wait for me here for a moment. Thank you, boss.

38
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:04,020
This is what I collected from around

39
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:05,580
They don’t want it anyway.

40
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:06,660
Give it to you for free
